{"lines": [{"text": "You pay nothing for this app. So how does it make billions?", "start": 0.5, "end": 3.572, "spec": null, "words": [["You", 0.091, 0.148], ["pay", 0.148, 0.284], ["nothing", 0.284, 0.625], ["for", 0.636, 0.739], ["this", 0.739, 0.909], ["app.", 0.909, 1.17], ["So", 1.545, 1.659], ["how", 1.67, 1.784], ["does", 1.784, 1.898], ["it", 1.898, 1.943], ["make", 1.943, 2.08], ["billions", 2.091, 2.727]]}, {"text": "Every time you open it, a tiny auction runs behind the screen.", "start": 5.2, "end": 8.752, "spec": null, "words": [["Every", 0.08, 0.239], ["time", 0.25, 0.466], ["you", 0.466, 0.58], ["open", 0.591, 0.818], ["it", 0.818, 0.955], ["a", 1.341, 1.386], ["tiny", 1.386, 1.795], ["auction", 1.795, 2.205], ["runs", 2.205, 2.489], ["behind", 2.5, 2.784], ["the", 2.784, 2.818], ["screen", 2.818, 3.216]]}, {"text": "Advertisers bid to show you an ad, based on what the app knows about your interests.", "start": 9.002, "end": 13.73, "spec": null, "words": [["Advertisers", 0.091, 0.807], ["bid", 0.864, 1.114], ["to", 1.125, 1.193], ["show", 1.205, 1.432], ["you", 1.432, 1.557], ["an", 1.557, 1.602], ["ad", 1.614, 1.909], ["based", 2.307, 2.545], ["on", 2.545, 2.614], ["what", 2.614, 2.716], ["the", 2.727, 2.841], ["app", 2.898, 3.136], ["knows", 3.148, 3.489], ["about", 3.489, 3.693], ["your", 3.693, 3.795], ["interests", 3.795, 4.386]]}, {"text": "The better the app knows you, the more an advertiser will pay for that one moment of your attention.", "start": 13.98, "end": 19.308, "spec": null, "words": [["The", 0.102, 0.159], ["better", 0.159, 0.375], ["the", 0.375, 0.477], ["app", 0.489, 0.784], ["knows", 0.795, 1.148], ["you", 1.148, 1.364], ["the", 1.807, 1.875], ["more", 1.875, 2.08], ["an", 2.08, 2.148], ["advertiser", 2.159, 2.739], ["will", 2.739, 2.841], ["pay", 2.841, 3.239], ["for", 3.33, 3.443], ["that", 3.455, 3.716], ["one", 3.727, 4.034], ["moment", 4.034, 4.352], ["of", 4.352, 4.409], ["your", 4.409, 4.534], ["attention", 4.534, 4.989]]}, {"text": "The highest bidder wins, the ad appears, and the app gets paid, often in about a tenth of a second.", "start": 19.558, "end": 25.486, "spec": null, "words": [["The", 0.102, 0.159], ["highest", 0.159, 0.58], ["bidder", 0.58, 0.807], ["wins", 0.818, 1.318], ["the", 1.477, 1.602], ["ad", 1.614, 1.807], ["appears", 1.807, 2.443], ["and", 2.636, 2.727], ["the", 2.727, 2.841], ["app", 2.92, 3.17], ["gets", 3.182, 3.364], ["paid", 3.364, 3.773], ["often", 4.136, 4.477], ["in", 4.477, 4.545], ["about", 4.545, 4.739], ["a", 4.739, 4.784], ["tenth", 4.795, 5.091], ["of", 5.091, 5.136], ["a", 5.136, 5.17], ["second", 5.17, 5.58]]}, {"text": "A single ad view earns very little, often well under one cent.", "start": 25.736, "end": 29.84, "spec": null, "words": [["A", 0.091, 0.136], ["single", 0.136, 0.466], ["ad", 0.466, 0.625], ["view", 0.625, 0.886], ["earns", 0.898, 1.205], ["very", 1.216, 1.568], ["little", 1.568, 1.932], ["often", 2.375, 2.739], ["well", 2.75, 3.034], ["under", 3.034, 3.193], ["one", 3.193, 3.364], ["cent", 3.364, 3.75]]}, {"text": "But the more time you spend, the more auctions run, and the more money flows to the app.", "start": 30.09, "end": 34.77, "spec": null, "words": [["But", 0.091, 0.159], ["the", 0.159, 0.216], ["more", 0.216, 0.364], ["time", 0.375, 0.614], ["you", 0.614, 0.705], ["spend", 0.716, 1.17], ["the", 1.42, 1.477], ["more", 1.477, 1.739], ["auctions", 1.75, 2.17], ["run", 2.17, 2.523], ["and", 2.92, 2.977], ["the", 2.977, 3.023], ["more", 3.034, 3.25], ["money", 3.25, 3.5], ["flows", 3.5, 3.818], ["to", 3.818, 3.898], ["the", 3.898, 4.011], ["app.", 4.011, 4.33]]}, {"text": "Endless feeds, notifications and autoplay are no accident. Each one adds a few more seconds to your visit.", "start": 35.02, "end": 42.46, "spec": null, "words": [["Endless", 0.08, 0.352], ["feeds", 0.352, 0.898], ["notifications", 1.08, 1.989], ["and", 2.102, 2.318], ["autoplay", 2.33, 3.08], ["are", 3.205, 3.341], ["no", 3.341, 3.602], ["accident", 3.602, 4.136], ["Each", 4.5, 4.67], ["one", 4.67, 4.955], ["adds", 5.216, 5.489], ["a", 5.625, 5.67], ["few", 5.67, 5.966], ["more", 5.966, 6.193], ["seconds", 6.193, 6.602], ["to", 6.602, 6.693], ["your", 6.693, 6.773], ["visit", 6.784, 7.114]]}, {"text": "Multiply those seconds by millions of users, and a free app becomes a very profitable machine.", "start": 42.71, "end": 48.494, "spec": null, "words": [["Multiply", 0.091, 0.591], ["those", 0.591, 0.807], ["seconds", 0.818, 1.307], ["by", 1.318, 1.432], ["millions", 1.432, 2.0], ["of", 2.0, 2.045], ["users", 2.045, 2.682], ["and", 2.909, 3.034], ["a", 3.045, 3.091], ["free", 3.091, 3.455], ["app", 3.466, 3.693], ["becomes", 3.705, 4.08], ["a", 4.091, 4.136], ["very", 4.136, 4.489], ["profitable", 4.489, 5.0], ["machine", 5.011, 5.432]]}, {"text": "You are not really the customer here. Your attention is the product being sold.", "start": 48.744, "end": 52.896, "spec": null, "words": [["You", 0.091, 0.159], ["are", 0.159, 0.205], ["not", 0.216, 0.5], ["really", 0.5, 0.716], ["the", 0.716, 0.795], ["customer", 0.795, 1.193], ["here", 1.205, 1.489], ["Your", 1.864, 2.0], ["attention", 2.0, 2.511], ["is", 2.636, 2.716], ["the", 2.716, 2.784], ["product", 2.784, 3.205], ["being", 3.205, 3.42], ["sold", 3.42, 3.83]]}, {"text": "So what is one hour of your attention worth to you?", "start": 53.146, "end": 55.81, "spec": null, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.239], ["what", 0.25, 0.386], ["is", 0.386, 0.5], ["one", 0.5, 0.841], ["hour", 0.852, 1.17], ["of", 1.182, 1.239], ["your", 1.239, 1.352], ["attention", 1.352, 1.727], ["worth", 1.727, 1.977], ["to", 1.977, 2.091], ["you", 2.102, 2.341]]}], "dur": 57.61}